IP address is always encrypted"'::jsonb, '"colspan"'::jsonb, '"DNS TTL"'::jsonb, '"font-family"'::jsonb, '"z-index on appropriately positioned elements"'::jsonb, '"Position every item at a fixed viewport coordinate"'::jsonb, '"Use flexible layout rules such as flexbox with wrapping and appropriate spacing"'::jsonb, '"Make every link a background image"'::jsonb, '"Use a meta title to space items"'::jsonb, '"Check only the page title"'::jsonb, '"Verify only animation speed"'::jsonb, '"Confirm stylesheet link/path, inspect loaded styles, validate element nesting and test links/image alt text at target sizes"'::jsonb, '"Confirm only the domain name and stop"'::jsonb, '"The network has no IP connectivity"'::jsonb, '"Name resolution and server contact worked; the requested resource path was not found"'::jsonb, '"DNS is definitely broken"'::jsonb, '"The browser cannot parse CSS"'::jsonb, '"Add a colspan attribute to the image"'::jsonb, '"Switch HTTP to FTP"'::jsonb, '"Set one dimension and preserve the intrinsic aspect ratio, or use an appropriate object-fit behavior"'::jsonb, '"Use font-weight to restore the image shape"'::jsonb, '"Correct the link/path or restore the stylesheet at the requested URL, then retest the page"'::jsonb, '"Rewrite every CSS rule without checking the URL"'::jsonb, '"Change the HTML title"'::jsonb, '"Replace all images with tables"'::jsonb, '"Define the animation as default and disable/reduce it under prefers-reduced-motion: reduce"'::jsonb, '"Use DNS caching to control animation"'::jsonb, '"Set every animation to infinite blink"'::jsonb, '"Use an HTML meta tag to force motion"'::jsonb, '"Increase movement until it becomes familiar"'::jsonb, '"Respect prefers-reduced-motion and provide a reduced-motion or no-animation state"'::jsonb, '"Use flashing text for emphasis"'::jsonb, '"Make animation mandatory in the HTML structure"'::jsonb, '"The class rule always beats an ID"'::jsonb, '"The type selector, because it is external"'::jsonb, '"The ID rule, because it has higher specificity"'::jsonb, '"The browser picks the first colour alphabetically"'::jsonb, '"DNS records/propagation and client resolver cache"'::jsonb, '"Form reset type"'::jsonb, '"HTML table spans"'::jsonb, '"CSS animation keyframes"'::jsonb, '"UDP guarantees every packet is delivered in order"'::jsonb, '"HTTP is a CSS style type"'::jsonb, '"TCP provides reliable ordered transport; UDP does not guarantee delivery/order"'::jsonb, '"FTP is the IP address version"'::jsonb, '"CSS can replace password storage controls"'::jsonb, '"HTTPS protects data in transit; it does not by itself secure how the server stores passwords"'::jsonb, '"HTTPS automatically encrypts the database at rest"'::jsonb, '"Plain-text storage is safe because the form is hidden"'::jsonb, '"Change all img tags to table tags"'::jsonb, '"Mixed content: serve the image resources securely too"'::jsonb, '"Use UDP to style the image"'::jsonb, '"Replace IPv6 with an HTML selector"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

