rect correction?"'::jsonb, '"A project claims a town plan followed Vastu Shastra because it has a grid layout. Which added evidence would most strengthen the claim?"'::jsonb, '"A student must compare an epic narrative with a modern engineering record. Which approach matches the course framing of Itihasa as a source of wisdom?"'::jsonb, '"A student groups ethics, livelihood, enjoyment and liberation into four ''tools of architecture''. What is the precise correction?"'::jsonb, '"A study links sacred ecology with forest management and urban planning. Which combination is the most syllabus-aligned?"'::jsonb, '"A presentation links traditional measurement with modern scientific units. Which method is strongest?"'::jsonb, '"A student''s notes define Jyotisha as poetic metre and Chandas as calendar study. Which correction is needed?"'::jsonb, '"A case study tries to show that a particular reservoir reflects historical water-management knowledge. What is the strongest evidence plan?"'::jsonb, '"A researcher wants to claim a specific metal technology was used at a named site, but the course outline only lists metalworking generally. What should they do?"'::jsonb, '"A presentation uses a mathematical example from an ancient text and says that it proves all current mathematics directly originated there. What is the key reasoning flaw?"'::jsonb, '"A report compares an irrigation canal, a rainwater harvesting structure and a town plan. Which source-area grouping best supports the comparison?"'::jsonb, '"A student wants to compare four Vedas, six Vedangas and four other branches without mixing categories. What is the correct count check?"'::jsonb, '"A team has to explain Caturdaśa-Vidyāsthāna and avoid confusing it with Catur-Ashrama. Which distinction is correct?"'::jsonb, '"A case says a person prioritizes ethical duty, livelihood, enjoyment and liberation. Which framework is being applied?"'::jsonb, '"A class compares Karma and rebirth with Moksha. Which relationship is the m