 in 80 words and keep the main claim and two key findings. Which technique is most suitable?"'::jsonb, '"A presenter wants to persuade an audience while remaining evidence-based. Which approach is strongest?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Subject: Read this!!!; Hey, open it now."'::jsonb, '"Subject: hi; I sent a thing."'::jsonb, '"Subject: Proposal; no greeting, no request, no deadline"'::jsonb, '"Subject: Review Request — Project Proposal; Dear Professor, could you review the attached proposal by Thursday?"'::jsonb, '"The project aims at reducing delays, accuracy improved and errors."'::jsonb, '"The project aims to reduce delays, improving accuracy and fewer errors."'::jsonb, '"The project aims to reduce delays, improve accuracy and reduce errors."'::jsonb, '"The project aims to reduce delays, accuracy and to be fewer errors."'::jsonb, '"The college is considering the timetable, but approval is not yet established."'::jsonb, '"The timetable has been implemented."'::jsonb, '"The timetable will definitely be used."'::jsonb, '"The timetable has been rejected."'::jsonb, '"The results are invalid because the group is not enormous."'::jsonb, '"The pilot suggests the method may help in similar settings, but a larger trial is needed."'::jsonb, '"The method will succeed for every department."'::jsonb, '"The pilot proves no further testing is useful."'::jsonb, '"A clear reason and dates, plus a request for approval"'::jsonb, '"An anonymous statement without dates"'::jsonb, '"A long description of unrelated hobbies"'::jsonb, '"Only a greeting"'::jsonb, '"The text expresses a possibility, not a universal conclusion."'::jsonb, '"The approach is proven effective at every campus."'::jsonb, '"The trial happened at every campus."'::jsonb, '"The wording proves the approach failed."'::jsonb, '"Report the comparable measurements and explain the differing condition before using the third value"'::jsonb, '"Pick whichever number supports the preferred conclusion"'::jsonb, '"Delete the methods from the report"'::jsonb, '"Combine all measurements as directly comparable without qualification"'::jsonb, '"Make the email longer without changing organization"'::jsonb, '"Use a specific subject, a descriptive filename and an early, explicit deadline"'::jsonb, '"Remove the deadline"'::jsonb, '"Attach multiple duplicate files"'::jsonb, '"Send an angry reminder"'::jsonb, '"Remove the subject line"'::jsonb, '"Clarify the required document, explain the reason for the deadline and propose a feasible time if needed"'::jsonb, '"Copy every person in the organization immediately"'::jsonb, '"The analyst, after data, changed because incomplete."'::jsonb, '"After reviewing the data, the analyst changed the conclusion because the earlier analysis was incomplete."'::jsonb, '"After reviewing the data, the conclusion reviewed the analyst."'::jsonb, '"The data was reviewing, so the conclusion changed it."'::jsonb, '"Move the request to a hidden footnote"'::jsonb, '"Add more adjectives"'::jsonb, '"Make every sentence passive"'::jsonb, '"Add a clear request and relevant dates near the beginning"'::jsonb, '"Ignore the question and change the slide"'::jsonb, '"Invent a source on the spot"'::jsonb, '"State that you cannot verify the source immediately and offer to follow up with a checked reference"'::jsonb, '"Insist the number must be right"'::jsonb, '"Inspect and disconnect whenever convenient."'::jsonb, '"Disconnect power and inspect things, then do the rest."'::jsonb, '"Reconnect power before removing the cover, unless it is not needed."'::jsonb, '"First disconnect power, then remove the cover, inspect the cable, and reconnect power only after refitting the cover."'::jsonb, '"Each of the reports contain a summary."'::jsonb, '"Each reports contains summaries."'::jsonb, '"Each of the report contain summary."'::jsonb, '"Each of the reports contains a summary."'::jsonb, '"When the supervisor arrived, we had already saved the file."'::jsonb, '"When the supervisor arrives, we had saved the file."'::jsonb, '"When the supervisor arriving, we have saved the file."'::jsonb, '"When the supervisor had arrived, we already save the file."'::jsonb, '"The planned testing phase is complete, while post-test monitoring is still ongoing."'::jsonb, '"The project is permanently finished in every respect."'::jsonb, '"No work has been completed."'::jsonb, '"The report contains no distinction between testing and monitoring."'::jsonb, '"Delete the attendance figures"'::jsonb, '"Claim that every participant gave the same reason"'::jsonb, '"State the cause as fact because the rise is visible"'::jsonb, '"Report the increase and note that the available data does not establish its cause"'::jsonb, '"Remove all headings from slides"'::jsonb, '"Use a clear outline with signposts and keep brief cue notes for the next section"'::jsonb, '"Memorize every word and never use notes"'::jsonb, '"End the session as soon as someone asks a question"'::jsonb, '"33⅓%"'::jsonb, '"25%"'::jsonb, '"30%"'::jsonb, '"20%"'::jsonb, '"Use unexplained abbreviations throughout"'::jsonb, '"Avoid all technical terms even when needed"'::jsonb, '"Use a different synonym every time"'::jsonb, '"Define each important term briefly, then use the same term consistently"'::jsonb, '"10%"'::jsonb, '"15%"'::jsonb, '"25%"'::jsonb, '"20%"'::jsonb, '"Approve it."'::jsonb, '"Please approve the attached visit plan by Friday; let me know if any additional information is required."'::jsonb, '"Attached. Need it now!!!"'::jsonb, '"I am sending something, so please decide."'::jsonb, '"Attendance definitely increased."'::jsonb, '"The survey proves every user supported the change."'::jsonb, '"The library expanded hours after a user survey."'::jsonb, '"The library has always been open longer in March."'::jsonb, '"Outcome first, random anecdotes and no dates"'::jsonb, '"Only personal reaction"'::jsonb, '"Background/purpose, chronological activities, outcomes and concise conclusion"'::jsonb, '"A list of adjectives followed by