en jobs?"'::jsonb, '"A user empties the Recycle Bin and the original file is no longer visible. Which statement is most accurate?"'::jsonb, '"A group must co-edit a spreadsheet, but other students must not edit it. What is the safest sharing plan?"'::jsonb, '"Sum values in F:F only for rows where A equals CE. Which formula is correct?"'::jsonb, '"Which nested IF implements Distinction ≥70%, First ≥60%, Second ≥50%, Pass ≥35%, otherwise Fail?"'::jsonb, '"A Linux user wants to inspect permissions and file details, including hidden entries, before changing access. Which command is safest?"'::jsonb, '"A ten-slide deck needs a consistent logo/footer and four images need motion effects. What is best?"'::jsonb, '"A copied formula multiplies each student''s amount by a fixed tax rate in B1. Which formula is safe to fill down from D2?"'::jsonb, '"An email must go to five friends, show faculty a copy, hide the coordinator, and include a route document. Which setup meets all conditions?"'::jsonb, '"A Windows PC is slow after startup. The user wants evidence about resource use before uninstalling software. What is the best first check?"'::jsonb, '"An installer asks to format a partition that may contain personal files. What is the safest response?"'::jsonb, '"An official-looking e-governance site asks for credentials. What should a user verify before signing in?"'::jsonb, '"A result formula labels 68% as Distinction although that threshold is 70%. What should be checked first?"'::jsonb, '"A report needs odd-page header ''Your investment'', even-page header ''Small Savings'', and page numbers in the footer. Which combination fits?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"The formula is necessarily wrong"'::jsonb, '"The worksheet has been filtered"'::jsonb, '"0.68 equals 68%; percentage formatting displays it as 68%"'::jsonb, '"It means 0.68 marks"'::jsonb, '"Delete personal documents"'::jsonb, '"Format the disk"'::jsonb, '"Use display recovery/safe mode or revert to a supported resolution"':