s personal preference only"'::jsonb, '"Municipal Corporation is the national election authority"'::jsonb, '"Municipal Corporation is urban local government; Zila Panchayat is rural local government at district level"'::jsonb, '"Zila Panchayat administers the Union Cabinet"'::jsonb, '"Both are Houses of Parliament"'::jsonb, '"42nd Amendment inserted the right to property as a Fundamental Right; 73rd created Rajya Sabha"'::jsonb, '"101st Amendment inserted Fundamental Duties"'::jsonb, '"42nd inserted Fundamental Duties; 86th added the duty of a parent/guardian to provide educational opportunities for children aged 6–14"'::jsonb, '"44th Amendment created the Preamble"'::jsonb, '"The Supreme Court as election organizer"'::jsonb, '"State Election Commission, under the constitutional local-body election framework"'::jsonb, '"Only the Governor personally"'::jsonb, '"The Zila Panchayat itself for all cities"'::jsonb, '"Only whether a government official signed the notice"'::jsonb, '"The name of the local municipal ward"'::jsonb, '"Only whether the person lives in a city"'::jsonb, '"The relevant Article 19 freedom, the restriction''s purpose and whether it meets the constitutional test"'::jsonb, '"Part IV"'::jsonb, '"Part IVA only"'::jsonb, '"Part II"'::jsonb, '"Part XV only"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

