ticle 51A"'::jsonb, '"Duty to serve as a judge"'::jsonb, '"Duty to protect the environment only"'::jsonb, '"Duty to safeguard public property and abjure violence"'::jsonb, '"Written constitutions can be amended according to their prescribed procedures"'::jsonb, '"Only Governors can amend the Constitution"'::jsonb, '"Written constitutions cannot change"'::jsonb, '"Amendments automatically replace all Fundamental Rights"'::jsonb, '"Article 324 election control"'::jsonb, '"Article 14 equality and non-arbitrariness"'::jsonb, '"The definition of a Municipal Corporation"'::jsonb, '"Article 51A environmental duty"'::jsonb, '"Municipal Corporation only in every case"'::jsonb, '"Union Legislature"'::jsonb, '"Supreme Court Registry"'::jsonb, '"District administration"'::jsonb, '"Article 51A alone"'::jsonb, '"The Constitution''s lawmaking procedure and whether Rajya Sabha''s participation is required for that measure"'::jsonb, '"The state Governor''s personal preference only"'::jsonb, '"The number of municipal wards"'::jsonb, '"Fundamental Rights are enforceable rights in Part III; Fundamental Duties are listed for citizens in Part IVA"'::jsonb, '"Duties are found only in local bylaws"'::jsonb, '"Both sets apply only to the President"'::jsonb, '"Rights are found only in Part IV"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

